  "description": "In 1999, seven-year-old Eugene Kim fell in love with his sweet, blonde next-door neighbor Morgan, making a childhood promise to marry before Morgan moved away. Ten years later, Eugene is a popular 17-year-old high school athlete still harboring feelings for his first love. When his long-lost neighbor finally moves back, Eugene rushes to fulfill their old promise… only to uncover a staggering truth: Morgan has always been a boy. Struggling to reconcile his high school persona with his confusing, lingering attraction to a handsome childhood friend, Eugene finds his comfortable world turned upside down in this charming romantic comedy. \n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/findmyangel), [Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/find_angel)\n\n**Official Translations:**  \nR19: [English](https://www.tappytoon.com/en/book/searching-for-my-angel-m)  \nR15: [English](https://www.tappytoon.com/en/book/searching-for-my-angel)",
